Z||000006||8Ball||10-23-2001||10:45 AM||||Ok as for makeing future repairs a PITA. I know the door skins attach at the top and the bottom not sure about the middle. do all the panels attach at the ttop and bottom and the middle? If so would it really hurt that much if they did not attach in the middle anymore?||||reg||1
Z||000007||Tigger||10-23-2001||10:56 AM||||Not being attached in the middle probably wouldn't hurt anything but would create more possibilites for rattles.||||reg||1
