Z||000011||Philphine||10-24-2001||11:10 AM||||yeah, i mixed it up. i looked and its in the tech section, the pics not very clear. there were a few others but they don't seem to be in any archives.<P>for the bumper repair, i got some 3m automix. it's like flexable epoxy. works good. my car got tapped and it didn't delaminate or anything. auto zone also has something similar for about half the price but i havent tried it yet. don't know how either would work on panels besides the facias.||||reg||1
